title: "FlashKDA on Blackwell: reproduction and three SM100 routes"
abstract: "Reproduction of FlashKDA on an NVIDIA B300, analysis of its SM80-MMA design, and three implemented alternatives (tcgen05 Phase 6, large-chunk rebasing, value-column split) with full-KDA correctness and complete-forward timing."
